, the temporary stopping of an event, the resumption of an event after a st=
op, and the end of an event, respectively. Not all events can have breaks i=
n them, in which case=20
         <quote>de'a</quote>and=20
+<!-- ^^   de'a, 229 -->
+<indexterm><primary>de'a</primary></indexterm>
