in (=20
     <quote>.oi</quote>) and pleasure (=20
     <quote>.oinai</quote>) which is intensely sexual (=20
     <quote>ro'u</quote>) in nature.</para>
+<!-- ^^   ro'u, 307 -->
+<indexterm><primary>ro'u</primary></indexterm>
