+<!-- ^^   la'a, 319 -->
+<indexterm><primary>la'a</primary></indexterm>
 </programlisting>
     <para>These two discursives describe the speaker's state of knowledge =
about the claim of the associated bridi. They are similar to the propositio=
nal attitudes of=20
+<!-- ^^   speaker's state of knowledge, 319 -->
