+<!-- ^^   propositional attitudes, 262; compared with knowledge discursive=
s, 319 -->
+<indexterm><primary>propositional attitudes</primary></indexterm>
     <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter13-section3" />, as they create a hypothet=
ical world. We may be quite certain that something is true, and label our b=
ridi with=20
+<!-- ^^   hypothetical world, 301; contrasted with real world, example, 32=
0 -->
