o a Lojbanized name by adding=20
     <quote>s</quote>and then into a Lojban lerfu word by adding=20
     <quote>bu</quote>. Note that the pause after=20
     <quote>.alfas.</quote>is still needed.</para>
     <para>Likewise, the easiest way to handle the Latin letters=20
     <quote>h</quote>,=20
