     </example>
     <para>(In some cultures, spaces are used in the symbolic representatio=
n of=20
     <xref linkend=3D"cll_chapter18-section3-example7" />;=20
     <quote>ki'o</quote>is still the Lojban representation.)</para>
+<!-- ^^   ki'o, 433 -->
+<indexterm><primary>ki'o</primary></indexterm>
     <para>It is also possible to have less than three digits between succe=
ssive=20
     <quote>ki'o</quote>s, in which case zeros are assumed to have been eli=
ded:</para>
+<!-- ^^   ki'o, 433 -->
+<indexterm><primary>ki'o</primary></indexterm>
