     <para>Here we calculate 3 + 4 first, giving 7, and then calculate 7 =
=C3=97 5 second, leading to the result 35. While possessing the advantage o=
f simplicity, this result violates the design goal of matching the standard=
s of mathematics. What can be done?</para>
     <para>There are three solutions, all of which will probably be used to=
 some degree. The first solution is to ignore the problem. People will say=
