 D use consonants different from those used in the decimal digit cmavo; E a=
nd F unfortunately overlap 2 and 4 - there was simply not enough available =
cmavo space to make a full differentiation possible. The cmavo are also in =
alphabetical order.</para>
     <para>The base point=20
+<!-- ^^   base point: in bases other than 10, 444 -->
