+<!-- ^^   tu'o, 450, 453; for infix operations with too few operands, 450 =
-->
+<indexterm><primary>tu'o</primary></indexterm>
     <quote>tu'o</quote>provides the second operand, which is semantically =
ignored but grammatically necessary. Likewise, the three-operand version of=
=20
+<!-- ^^   tu'o, 450, 453; for infix operations with too few operands, 450 =
-->
