     <quote>goi</quote>or=20
     <quote>cei</quote>. Bound variable pro-sumti and pro-bridi also genera=
lly last until re-bound; details are available in=20
+<!-- ^^   cei, 151, 154, 162; for broda-series pro-bridi assignment, 151 -=
